{"text":"kuruntokai","n":182,"lines":["விழுத்தலைப் பெண்ணை விளையன் மாமடல்","மணியணி பெருந்தார் மரபிற் பூட்டி","வெள்ளென் பணிந்துபிறர் எள்ளத் தோன்றி","ஒருநாண் மருங்கிற் பெருநா ணீக்கித்","தெருவின் இயலவும் தருவது கொல்லோ","கலிந்தவிர் அசைநடைப் பேதை","மெலிந்தில ணாம்விடற் கமைந்த தூதே"],"tr":["viḻuttalaip peṇṇai viḷaiyaṉ māmaṭal","maṇiyaṇi peruntār marapiṟ pūṭṭi","veḷḷeṉ paṇintupiṟar eḷḷat tōṉṟi","orunāṇ maruṅkiṟ perunā ṇīkkit","teruviṉ iyalavum taruvatu kollō","kalintavir acainaṭaip pētai","melintila ṇāmviṭaṟ kamainta tūtē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவன் கூற்று","poet_ta":"மடல் பாடிய மாதங்கீரனார்","speaker_en":"the hero (talaivaṉ)","poet_tr":"Maṭal Pāṭiya Mātaṅkīraṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"7 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"6×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 26, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 15, āciriyattaḷai 11"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"விழுத்தலைப்","tr":"viḻuttalaip","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"விழுத்","tr":"viḻut"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலைப்","tr":"talaip"}]},{"text":"பெண்ணை","tr":"peṇṇai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பெண்","tr":"peṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணை","tr":"ṇai"}]},{"text":"விளையன்","tr":"viḷaiyaṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"விளை","tr":"viḷai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யன்","tr":"yaṉ"}]},{"text":"மாமடல்","tr":"māmaṭal","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மடல்","tr":"maṭal"}]}],[{"text":"மணியணி","tr":"maṇiyaṇi","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மணி","tr":"maṇi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யணி","tr":"yaṇi"}]},{"text":"பெருந்தார்","tr":"peruntār","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெருந்","tr":"perun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தார்","tr":"tār"}]},{"text":"மரபிற்","tr":"marapiṟ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மர","tr":"mara"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பிற்","tr":"piṟ"}]},{"text":"பூட்டி","tr":"pūṭṭi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பூட்","tr":"pūṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டி","tr":"ṭi"}]}],[{"text":"வெள்ளென்","tr":"veḷḷeṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெள்","tr":"veḷ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளென்","tr":"ḷeṉ"}]},{"text":"பணிந்துபிறர்","tr":"paṇintupiṟar","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பணிந்","tr":"paṇin"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"துபி","tr":"tupi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றர்","tr":"ṟar"}]},{"text":"எள்ளத்","tr":"eḷḷat","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"எள்","tr":"eḷ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளத்","tr":"ḷat"}]},{"text":"தோன்றி","tr":"tōṉṟi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோன்","tr":"tōṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றி","tr":"ṟi"}]}],[{"text":"ஒருநாண்","tr":"orunāṇ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ஒரு","tr":"oru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நாண்","tr":"nāṇ"}]},{"text":"மருங்கிற்","tr":"maruṅkiṟ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மருங்","tr":"maruṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கிற்","tr":"kiṟ"}]},{"text":"பெருநா","tr":"perunā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெரு","tr":"peru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"}]},{"text":"ணீக்கித்","tr":"ṇīkkit","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணீக்","tr":"ṇīk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கித்","tr":"kit"}]}],[{"text":"தெருவின்","tr":"teruviṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தெரு","tr":"teru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வின்","tr":"viṉ"}]},{"text":"இயலவும்","tr":"iyalavum","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இய","tr":"iya"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லவும்","tr":"lavum"}]},{"text":"தருவது","tr":"taruvatu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தரு","tr":"taru"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வது","tr":"vatu"}]},{"text":"கொல்லோ","tr":"kollō","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொல்","tr":"kol"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லோ","tr":"lō"}]}],[{"text":"கலிந்தவிர்","tr":"kalintavir","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கலிந்","tr":"kalin"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தவிர்","tr":"tavir"}]},{"text":"அசைநடைப்","tr":"acainaṭaip","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அசை","tr":"acai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"நடைப்","tr":"naṭaip"}]},{"text":"பேதை","tr":"pētai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பே","tr":"pē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தை","tr":"tai"}]}],[{"text":"மெலிந்தில","tr":"melintila","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மெலிந்","tr":"melin"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தில","tr":"tila"}]},{"text":"ணாம்விடற்","tr":"ṇāmviṭaṟ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணாம்","tr":"ṇām"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"விடற்","tr":"viṭaṟ"}]},{"text":"கமைந்த","tr":"kamainta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கமைந்","tr":"kamain"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"தூதே","tr":"tūtē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தூ","tr":"tū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"விழுத்தலைப்","parts":[{"text":"விழுத்தலைப்","lemma":"விழுத்தலைப்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெண்ணை","parts":[{"text":"பெண்ணை","lemma":"பெண்ணை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"விளையன்","parts":[{"text":"விளையன்","lemma":"விளையன்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மாமடல்","parts":[{"text":"மாமடல்","lemma":"மாமடல்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"மணியணி","parts":[{"text":"மணியணி","lemma":"மணியணி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெருந்தார்","parts":[{"text":"பெருந்தார்","lemma":"பெருந்தார்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மரபிற்","parts":[{"text":"மரபிற்","lemma":"மரபிற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பூட்டி","parts":[{"text":"பூட்டி","lemma":"பூட்டி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"வெள்","parts":[{"text":"வெள்","lemma":"veḷ","gloss":"white"}],"gloss":"white"},{"surface":"என்பு","parts":[{"text":"என்பு","lemma":"eṉpu","gloss":"bone"}],"gloss":"bones"},{"surface":"அணிந்து","parts":[{"text":"அணிந்து","lemma":"அணிந்து","gloss":"having worn"}],"gloss":"having worn","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பிறர்","parts":[{"text":"பிறர்","lemma":"piṟar","gloss":"others"}],"gloss":"others"},{"surface":"எள்ள","parts":[{"text":"எள்ளு","lemma":"eḷḷu","gloss":"mock"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to mock"},{"surface":"தோன்றி","parts":[{"text":"தோன்று","lemma":"tōṉṟu","gloss":"appear"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having appeared"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒருநாண்","parts":[{"text":"ஒருநாண்","lemma":"ஒருநாண்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மருங்கிற்","parts":[{"text":"மருங்கிற்","lemma":"மருங்கிற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெருநா","parts":[{"text":"பெருநா","lemma":"பெருநா","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ணீக்கித்","parts":[{"text":"ணீக்கித்","lemma":"ணீக்கித்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"தெருவின்","parts":[{"text":"தெரு","lemma":"teru","gloss":"street"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"locative suffix"}],"gloss":"in the street"},{"surface":"இயலவும்","parts":[{"text":"இயல்","lemma":"iyal","gloss":"walk"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"infinitive suffix"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even to walk"},{"surface":"தருவது","parts":[{"text":"தரு","lemma":"taru","gloss":"bring"},{"text":"வது","lemma":"vatu","gloss":"participial noun suffix"}],"gloss":"that which brings"},{"surface":"கொல்லோ","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"kol","gloss":"particle of doubt"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ō","gloss":"emphatic clitic"}],"gloss":"will it indeed?"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கலிந்து","parts":[{"text":"கலி","lemma":"kali","gloss":"be proud"},{"text":"ந்து","lemma":"ntu","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"proudly"},{"surface":"அவிர்","parts":[{"text":"அவிர்","lemma":"avir","gloss":"shining"}],"gloss":"shining"},{"surface":"அசை","parts":[{"text":"அசை","lemma":"asai","gloss":"swaying"}],"gloss":"swaying"},{"surface":"நடை","parts":[{"text":"நடை","lemma":"naṭai","gloss":"gait"}],"gloss":"gait"},{"surface":"பேதை","parts":[{"text":"பேதை","lemma":"pētai","gloss":"innocent girl"}],"gloss":"innocent girl"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மெலிந்தில","parts":[{"text":"மெலிந்தில","lemma":"மெலிந்தில","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ணாம்விடற்","parts":[{"text":"ணாம்விடற்","lemma":"ணாம்விடற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கமைந்த","parts":[{"text":"கமைந்த","lemma":"கமைந்த","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தூதே","parts":[{"text":"தூதே","lemma":"தூதே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"Excellent-headed palmyra palm's tender great leaf-stalks, / with beautiful bells and a large garland, according to tradition having fastened, / white bones having worn, so that others mock, having appeared, / within the span of one day, casting away great modesty, / even to walk in the street, will it indeed bring? / The proudly shining, swaying-gaited innocent girl, / she did not grow thin, for us to send the appropriate messenger.","translation":"Will my love indeed bring me to cast away my great modesty in a single day, and walk the streets riding a horse made of tender, large palmyra leaf-stalks from the fine-headed palm tree, decorated with beautiful bells and a large garland according to custom, wearing white bones while others mock? That innocent girl of proud, shining, swaying gait has not relented or grown thin, so that we might send a proper messenger.","modern":"சிறந்த உச்சியைக் கொண்ட பனைமரத்தின் இளமையான பெரிய மடல் குதிரையை, அழகிய மணிகள் பூட்டிய பெரிய மாலையோடு மரபுப்படி கட்டி, வெண்மையான எலும்புகளை அணிந்துகொண்டு மற்றவர்கள் எள்ளி நகையாடுமாறு தெருவில் தோன்றி, ஒரே நாளில் எனது பெரிய நாணத்தை விடுத்துத் தெருவில் உலா வரச் செய்யுமோ? பெருமிதமும் ஒளியும் கொண்ட அசைந்து நடக்கும் நடையுடைய அந்தப் பேதை, நாம் தூது அனுப்புவதற்கு ஏற்றவாறு மெலிவடையவில்லை.","explanation":"The hero is speaking to himself or his friend in a state of deep distress because his love is unfulfilled. He contemplates riding the 'maṭal'—a mock horse made of rough palmyra stems—to publicize his love and force the heroine's family to agree to their marriage. This desperate act involves abandoning all shame in a single day, wearing bones, and riding through the streets while being mocked by onlookers. He laments that the heroine, with her beautiful swaying gait, has not grown thin with longing or shown any pity. Because she remains unaffected, sending a conventional messenger to plead his case would be entirely useless.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}